{"ts": 1791256383.0131981, "type": "step", "step": 18, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Yes \u2014 here\u2019s the answer for POMDP:\n\nA POMDP is a setting where the agent cannot fully observe the true state of the environment. Instead, it only gets partial observations, so it has to maintain a belief about what state it\u2019s likely in and may choose actions to gather more information.\n\nA very usable writeup sentence is:\n\u201cOur environment is partially observable (a POMDP): the agent does not directly see the full state, so it uses observations to maintain a belief and may take information-gathering actions.\u201d", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "week3-environments"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\nStudent: honestly can you just give me the answer, I'm stuck on pomdp\n[activity] t=11 messages 1m", "t": 12, "activity": [{"t": 11, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.34538088511058934, "pass_k": 0.4312686500050733}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9213219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.7740148929158048, "persistence": 0.38206578426655546, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": []}}
