{"ts": 1791256387.415415, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "No problem \u2014 let\u2019s simplify POMDP.\n\nThink of it like this:\n- **State** = what is really true in the environment\n- **Observation** = only the part the agent can see\n- **Action** = what the agent can do\n- **POMDP** = the agent cannot see the full state, only partial observations\n\nSo the key idea is: the agent has to make decisions without full information, often by keeping a belief about what the hidden state might be.\n\nTiny example: a robot in a foggy room can\u2019t see the whole room, so it uses what it can sense and may move to get a better view.\n\nIf you want, reply with your own one-sentence definition and I\u2019ll fix it.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-environments"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: sure\nStudent: honestly can you just give me the answer, I'm stuck on pomdp\n[activity] t=14 messages 4m", "t": 18, "activity": [{"t": 14, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.42263316653324795, "pass_k": 0.4312686500050733}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9213219651533417, "motivation": 0.40784989287081264, "reliance": 0.9340148929158048, "persistence": 0.3220657842665554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.1988213099999996, "seen_posts": []}}
